stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    state "THE PAGE IS EMPTY" as Empty

    state "LOOKING AT A THING" as Looking
    Looking : You consider the Fine Plate Bracer.
    Looking : he cons it and quotes the cheapest hand
    Looking : commits nothing

    state "THINGS ON THE PAGE" as Listed
    Listed : mark toggles a line off
    Listed : stepper changes a quantity
    Listed : running total always visible

    state "HE HAS NAMED HANDS" as Offered
    Offered : not Grimtooth, and he re-quotes
    Offered : who else, and he reads the roster
    Offered : name a hand to pin him
    Offered : changing the page forces a re-quote

    state "SEALED AND SENT" as Sealed
    Sealed : one order per hand
    Sealed : vetoes and pins cleared

    [*] --> Empty
    Empty --> Looking : click a row, or type its name
    Looking --> Empty : wanted none of it
    Looking --> Listed : click the mark, or say add it
    Empty --> Listed : click the mark on a row
    Listed --> Looking : click another row
    Listed --> Empty : last line removed
    Listed --> Offered : Ask him to place it
    Offered --> Listed : back to The page tab
    Offered --> Empty : every line removed
    Offered --> Sealed : Seal it
    Sealed --> Empty : start over
